{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-title='Management'>\r\n\t\t\tManagement\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Add and delete users and groups, passwords, ACLs, and sudoers.d.","label":"Users","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/management\/uninstall","label":"Uninstall","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/uninstall"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/management\/version","label":"Version","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/version"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>User<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Add<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNo-prompt:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>useradd\n\/usr\/sbin\/useradd &lt;name&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPrompt: <code class='inline'>adduser<\/code> creates the requisite directories and provisions the rest.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>adduser<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Delete<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: these commands remove a user account.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>userdel<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>deluser --remove-home<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>No login<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNo-login account: <code class='inline'>_<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Password<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>passwd [user]<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Filesystem rights<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>setfacl -R -m user:&lt;user&gt;:rwx &lt;path&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Group<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThere is no group of groups. Only users in a group.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Add<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>groupadd &lt;group&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Remove<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>groupdel &lt;group&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Filesystem rights<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>chgrp -R &lt;group&gt; &lt;path&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Show<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGroups are listed in <code class='inline'>\/etc\/group<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>cut -d: -f1 \/etc\/group<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>User and group<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Add to group<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>usermod -a -g &lt;group&gt; &lt;User&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>-a<\/code> appends, with removing from other groups.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Sudo group<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tA user can be added to a group, but a file under <code class='inline'>\/etc\/sudoers.d<\/code> is better for upgrades. Preferred:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;user&gt; ALL=(ALL:ALL) ALL<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/users\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/users\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/uninstall' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management\/uninstall' data-title='Uninstall' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Uninstall<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management\/version' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management\/version' data-title='Version' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Version<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/management' data-title='Management'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Management<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}